<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ --><!-- 📖 SECCIÓN: VERSÍCULO                                       --><!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="relative w-full py-6 sm:py-10 md:py-12 lg:py-16">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="flex justify-center">
            <div class="relative w-full max-w-[320px]" id="card-versiculo">
                <!-- Texto libre, sin card -->
                <div class="relative" id="card-principal-versiculo">
                    <div
                        class="relative px-2 py-0 z-10 flex flex-col items-center justify-center"
                    >
                        <!-- Ornamento superior -->
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6 w-full">
                            <div
                                class="h-px flex-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent to-[#A88C61]/45"
                            >
                            </div>
                            <span class="text-[#A88C61] text-sm opacity-70"
                                >✦</span
                            >
                            <div
                                class="h-px flex-1 bg-gradient-to-l from-transparent to-[#A88C61]/45"
                            >
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Texto del versículo -->
                        <p
                            id="texto-versiculo"
                            class="font-crimson text-xl text-center leading-relaxed text-[#B34155] mb-6"
                        >
                            El amor nunca se da por vencido, jamás pierde la fe,
                            siempre tiene esperanzas y se mantiene firme en toda
                            circunstancia.
                        </p>

                        <!-- Cita bíblica -->
                        <p
                            id="cita-versiculo"
                            class="font-crimson text-sm sm:text-base text-center uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-semibold text-[#A88C61]"
                        >
                            1 Corintios 13:7
                        </p>

                        <!-- Ornamento inferior -->
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mt-6 w-full">
                            <div
                                class="h-px flex-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent to-[#A88C61]/45"
                            >
                            </div>
                            <span class="text-[#A88C61] text-sm opacity-70"
                                >✦</span
                            >
                            <div
                                class="h-px flex-1 bg-gradient-to-l from-transparent to-[#A88C61]/45"
                            >
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<script>
    import { gsap } from "gsap";
    import { ScrollTrigger } from "gsap/ScrollTrigger";

    gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);

    if (typeof window !== "undefined") {
        document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", () => {
            gsap.fromTo(
                "#card-principal-versiculo",
                { opacity: 0, y: 50, scale: 0.95 },
                {
                    opacity: 1,
                    y: 0,
                    scale: 1,
                    duration: 1,
                    ease: "power3.out",
                    scrollTrigger: {
                        trigger: "#card-versiculo",
                        start: "top 80%",
                        toggleActions: "play none none reset",
                    },
                },
            );

            gsap.fromTo(
                "#texto-versiculo",
                { opacity: 0, y: 20 },
                {
                    opacity: 1,
                    y: 0,
                    duration: 0.9,
                    delay: 0.3,
                    ease: "power2.out",
                    scrollTrigger: {
                        trigger: "#card-versiculo",
                        start: "top 80%",
                        toggleActions: "play none none reset",
                    },
                },
            );

            gsap.fromTo(
                "#cita-versiculo",
                { opacity: 0, y: 10 },
                {
                    opacity: 1,
                    y: 0,
                    duration: 0.7,
                    delay: 0.6,
                    ease: "power2.out",
                    scrollTrigger: {
                        trigger: "#card-versiculo",
                        start: "top 80%",
                        toggleActions: "play none none reset",
                    },
                },
            );
        });
    }
</script>
